<title>NORWAY: Oil output reduced briefly at Statoil's Statfjord.</title>
<headline>Oil output reduced briefly at Statoil's Statfjord.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crude output on the North Sea Statfjord B platform was reduced on Tuesday for maintenance work, operator Den norske stats oljeselskap AS said.</p>
<p>&quot;Production is reduced on Statfjord B just for a matter of hours while we carry out some minor maintenance work,&quot; said Statoil spokesman Odd Jan Lange.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be reduced throughout the day and back to normal tomorrow,&quot; Lange said.</p>
<p>No immediate figure was avaialble for output at Statfjord B although the platform pumped 137,619 barrels on Monday.</p>
<p>All other operations at the giant Statfjord development were normal, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
